kpi Matches failed | 48,200
kpi Region | EU-West

# What happened

A Terraform change replaced the weighted DNS records for match.eu with a single record. That record pointed at a decommissioned load balancer. Negative caching, with a TTL of 3600 seconds, kept the failures going after the fix.

# Timeline

table = Time (UTC),Event; 09:12,Terraform apply; 09:15,success rate drops; 09:31,player reports spike on social media; 09:40,incident declared; 10:05,bad record identified; 10:11,record restored; 11:04,success rate back above 99 percent and incident resolved

